Package: mydesksearch
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: MyDeskSearch <mydesksearch@example.com>
Depends: bash, debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0
Description: Search file and folder names
 Always-on-top widget that indexes file and folder names.
 Choose Korean or English while installing. The same choice is in the program settings.
 An existing installation is removed before the new files are installed.
